  specialEffectName: SOLEMNITY
  desc_tactics: "Hospitalar supports her allies from the backline, keeping her team
    alive as long as she stays breathing. She has trouble targeting enemies at the
    front. Her Blessed Strike damages the enemy from a far and heals herself for
    a small amount, as well as granting her a stack of Solemnity. Her signature Auxilium
    heals an ally, grants Resilient as well as Critical Available to them. Auxilium
    consumes all stacks of Solemnity, its healing amount is increased for each Solemnity
    stack she had. Hospitalar has Holy Aura to heal her entire team based on her
    attack damage, and Cleansing Reflect to cleanse an ally from Mark and Deep Wound.
    I\u2019ll Take Your Place will have her take damage for an ally, while giving
    herself Armor, Critical Available and Solemnity. Surgical Precision deals more
    damage to Marked targets, as well as a chance to Stun them. Combo those two together
    and she ensures to Stun an enemy, as Surgical Precision is guaranteed to Stun
    while she is Guarding. Be careful not to overuse her Guard due to her low Max
    HP. "
